        "composite one of GREEN/YELLOW/ORANGE/RED"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Use threshold definitions from references/thresholds.example.json",
    "Include the fixed marker date 2025-05-14 in outputs",
    "Handle missing or stale inputs with explicit data gaps"
  ]
